        560,
        229
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDELYKLEON",
      "text": "(Shouts to the slaves from the roof.)\nXanthias and Sosias, are you asleep?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        89,
        233,
        373,
        261
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "XANTHIAS",
      "text": "Oh dear, poor me!",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        89,
        268,
        289,
        293
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOSIAS",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        89,
        300,
        827,
        338
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "XAN.",
      "text": "The master is no longer sleeping, but is already standing and shouting.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        338,
        506,
        373
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOS.",
      "text": "But to whom is the man speaking?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        374,
        901,
        487
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "XAN.",
      "text": "Bdelykleon is saying something to us, as it seems to me. And our master, on\nhappening upon us sleeping, will destroy [us].",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        87,
        489,
        877,
        553
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOS.",
      "text": "He seems to me too to be saying something, Xanthias. But wanting what are\nyou standing up/what need makes you stand up, master?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        89,
        557,
        882,
        780
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "What need? In theory my father is quiet, Sosias, but in practice he wants to\ngo out. And my father always uses audacity when he wants to go out. But\nnow, as it seems to me at any rate, my father, having gone into the oven, is\nseeking a hole with great zeal. Lord Poseidon, whatever noise is the chimney\nmaking?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        214,
        782,
        555,
        820
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Out of the chimney comes Philokleon.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        191,
        823,
        377,
        856
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You, who are you?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
